        "original_id": "15b6d416-618c-5488-9f18-b3394360e74e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Graham Linehan, Arthur Mathews, Ash Atalla, Chris O'Dowd, Richard Ayoade, Katherine Parkinson, Matt Berry\n- Products: Father Ted, Black Books, The IT Crowd, Hippies\n- Companies: Channel 4\n\nFacts:\n- Graham Linehan is most noted for the sitcoms Father Ted, Black Books, and The IT Crowd.\n- The IT Crowd is a British sitcom by Channel 4, written by Graham Linehan and produced by Ash Atalla.\n- The IT Crowd stars Chris O'Dowd, Richard Ayoade, Katherine Parkinson, and Matt Berry.\n- Hippies was created by Arthur Mathews and Graham Linehan.\n- Arthur Mathews and Graham Linehan were the writing partnership most famous for Father Ted.\n- The scripts for Hippies were written by Arthur Mathews alone.",
